{"unit_id":"qe2592008__dsh-ui-customizer#feature-1","repo":"qe2592008/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eabfb1c11d01559d14992c5f1102afb20c93affd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Customizer 的功能「背景壁纸」：在设置页输入图片地址或上传图片，并用预览裁剪、选择填充方式及调整透明度、模糊和暗化，让壁纸显示在整个界面内容后方。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1262-1327","lib/client.js:1944-2050"]}
{"unit_id":"qe2592008__dsh-ui-customizer#feature-2","repo":"qe2592008/dsh-ui-customizer","commit":"eabfb1c11d01559d14992c5f1102afb20c93affd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH UI Customizer 的功能「视频背景」：在背景设置中切换到视频，输入地址或上传本地视频；背景静音循环播放，并随当前填充、透明度、模糊和暗化设置显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1481-1525","lib/client.js:1944-2050"]}
